  <Title type="string">An exhibition of nothing, on purpose</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">The artist talks about a sculpture made entirely of hesitation. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</synopsis>
  <languages type="languageChoices">etr: Edolo;qaa-x-kurbin: Kürbinian;tpi</languages>
